        <section xml:id="sec-lsai-outcomes">
            <title>Linear Systems, Applications, and Independence</title>
            <introduction><p>Here are the assessment outcomes for Linear Systems, Applications, and Independence. There are multiple versions 
                of each outcome so that there are options for multiple semesters of assessments. This section is 
                divided into 4 outcomes:
                <ul>
                <li><p>Linear Systems</p></li>
                <li><p>Linear Independence</p></li>
                <li><p>Transformations of Linear Systems</p></li>
                <li><p>Applications of Linear Systems</p></li>
                </ul></p></introduction>
